    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SOPHIA: Are you OK?\nBELLA O/S: Her heart is broken.\nSOPHIA: Do you know her?\nSOPHIA: How do you know her heart's broken?",
      "BELLA: Mama, this is Sophia, I'm just gonna show her upstairs.\nANGELINA: Looks like you'll be having a busy night.\nBELLA: This way.",
      "BELLA: Ladies, this is Sophia.\nBELLA: These are The Secretaries of Juliet. We respond to the letters she receives from around the world.\nSOPHIA: You mean you actually write back? To everyone?\nBELLA: We give answers.",
      "SOPHIA: So? How do you decide which of you answers which letter?\nBELLA: We all have our areas of expertise.\nBELLA: Maria has been happily married for fifty-one years so she tends to handle mostly marital issues...\nBELLA: Francesca made her living as a nurse so she usually does illness and caring for the sick...",
      "SOPHIA: Do you ever worry about being wrong?\nBELLA: What do you mean?\nSOPHIA: You're giving answers but how do you know they're the right answers?\nBELLA: We don't tell anyone what to do, we just share our experiences, we let them know they're not alone. There are no wrong right or wrong answer…"
    ]
  },
